======================================================================================
  THE CEILING A COVERAGE FILL COULD REACH — a lower bound is not an absence
======================================================================================
  110 joined · 41 unjoined · a complete fill scales each band by 1.373
  ADVERSARIAL  — every unjoined event handed to the cheapest bands: at most 3 bands could clear.
  PROPORTIONAL — unjoined events distributed like the joined ones: 2 bands clear (1.4, 9.6, 30.2, 49.4, 4.1, 19.2, 1.4, 11.0, 5.5, 1.4, 2.7, 6.9, 4.1, 1.4, 1.4, 1.4).
  Neither is a prediction. Filling SOURCE-001's coverage series between the two cycles is the measurement that would replace them.

